{
  "id": "E215",
  "title": "Do You Have Time This Evening?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-04-26",
  "synopsis": "Ben wants to watch a movie together with Lili.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/723/20725820fe49ec3bfcc880c180280cfaa075a008.mp3?1524486399",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你今晚有时间吗？\n\n本：丽丽，你今晚有时间吗？我请你去看电影吧。\n丽丽：抱歉，今晚我有很多作业要做。\n本：那明晚呢？\n丽丽：不好意思，明晚我要和一个朋友一起吃饭。\n本：那你什么时候有时间？\n丽丽：下个周末吧。\n本：可是下个星期电影院就没有这个电影了。",
    "traditional": "你今晚有時間嗎？\n\n本：麗麗，你今晚有時間嗎？我請你去看電影吧。\n麗麗：抱歉，今晚我有很多作業要做。\n本：那明晚呢？\n麗麗：不好意思，明晚我要和一個朋友一起吃飯。\n本：那你什麼時候有時間？\n麗麗：下個週末吧。\n本：可是下個星期電影院就沒有這個電影了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do you have time this evening?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，你今晚有时间吗？我请你去看电影吧。",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，你今晚有時間嗎？我請你去看電影吧。",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì nǐ jīn wǎn yǒu shí jiān ma wǒ qǐng nǐ qù kàn diàn yǐng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, do you have time this evening? Let me treat you to a movie."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：抱歉，今晚我有很多作业要做。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：抱歉，今晚我有很多作業要做。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bào qiàn jīn wǎn wǒ yǒu hěn duō zuò yè yào zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I’m sorry, I have a lot of homework to do tonight."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：那明晚呢？",
      "traditional": "本：那明晚呢？",
      "pinyin": "běn nà míng wǎn ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What about tomorrow evening?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：不好意思，明晚我要和一个朋友一起吃饭。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：不好意思，明晚我要和一個朋友一起吃飯。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bù hǎo yì si míng wǎn wǒ yào hé yí ge péng you yì qǐ chī fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Sorry, I’m going to have dinner with a friend."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：那你什么时候有时间？",
      "traditional": "本：那你什麼時候有時間？",
      "pinyin": "běn nà nǐ shén me shí hou yǒu shí jiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: When will you have time then?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：下个周末吧。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：下個週末吧。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì xià ge zhōu mò ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Maybe next weekend."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：可是下个星期电影院就没有这个电影了。",
      "traditional": "本：可是下個星期電影院就沒有這個電影了。",
      "pinyin": "běn kě shì xià ge xīng qī diàn yǐng yuàn jiù méi yǒu zhè ge diàn yǐng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: But this movie will be taken out of theaters next week."
    }
  ],
